# Raw upstream sources committed as .csv.gz (~35 MB vs ~200 MB raw).
# TS readLocalFile auto-decompresses; Python runs `bash scripts/extract-data.sh`
# once to materialize the .csv. See scripts/pull-all-data-sources.sh.
